---
import Mark from '../brand/Mark.astro';
import PlainSummary from '../PlainSummary.astro';
---
<section class="sec" id="problem" aria-labelledby="problem-h" data-depth="0.2" data-scene="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="col smudge">
      <p class="eyebrow">INCIDENT REPORT · READING CONDITIONS</p>
      <h2 class="h2 recede-h" id="problem-h">The wiki was built to edit. Deepwell is built to read.</h2>
      <p class="narr recede">The SCP Wiki is one of the internet’s greatest collaborative works: thousands of writers, nearly twenty thousand files, decades of dread. Unfortunately at times its reading conditions are, per standing assessment, poor. Cramped columns, tiny text, no dark mode worth the name, no offline access, and it forgets you the moment you close the tab. Personnel have been studying hazardous material in bad light. Deepwell fixes the reading and leaves the archive exactly where it belongs: free, open, and credited to the people who wrote it.</p>
      <PlainSummary>The wiki is great to read but can be hard on the eyes. Deepwell seeks to provide a more comfortable experience. It could never replace the wiki.</PlainSummary>
    </div>
    <div class="emerge" aria-hidden="true"><Mark color="#EADFC6" /></div>
  </div>
</section>
